      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/potters_hill_north_carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s name honors Thomas Hay, Viscount Dupplin, an English Board of Trade member who pushed colonial policies in the 1740s.",
